1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:06,910
In late 2025, Cyclone Ditwah brought floods that claimed more than 600 lives in Sri Lanka.

2
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:08,660
Every minute of warning matters.

3
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:13,860
Today, warnings are fragmented, unverified, and easy to miss.

4
00:00:14,060 --> 00:00:17,430
Shelters and volunteers are coordinated by phone calls,

5
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:20,330
and when networks fail, people are left in the dark.

6
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:22,700
Meet SafeZone.

7
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:28,400
One platform that connects citizens and authorities before, during, and after a disaster.

8
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:34,400
Authorities broadcast geo-targeted alerts that reach citizens in real time.

9
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:40,520
Citizens report incidents and confirm each other's reports, building a trusted picture on the ground.

10
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:45,690
And families stay connected with one-tap I'm Safe check-ins and live location sharing.

11
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:52,220
What sets us apart? Offline-first maps, so safety information works without signal.

12
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:55,390
Community-verified reports with credibility scoring.

13
00:00:55,590 --> 00:00:57,350
Support for Sinhala and Tamil.

14
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:01,510
And reach analytics that show authorities exactly who has been alerted.

15
00:01:02,810 --> 00:01:04,380
Our proposed model is simple.

16
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:09,080
Annual licences for disaster management agencies and local councils,

17
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:12,780
subscriptions for NGOs and volunteer organisations,

18
00:01:12,980 --> 00:01:15,700
and data partnerships with insurers and utilities.

19
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,220
Today, we have a working app with citizen, shelter, and authority tools.

20
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:25,760
Next, we pilot in a flood-prone district with a disaster-management partner.

21
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:31,560
We're looking for pilot partners and seed investment to bring SafeZone to every community at risk.

22
00:01:32,860 --> 00:01:34,820
SafeZone. Every minute matters.

23
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:36,750
We are The Pioneers. Thank you.

